export anchor DarkMeshGradientStyle:
    number: 261
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark mesh gradient
    idea: Soft blurred glows of violet, teal and coral drift behind smoked glass panels, with the tools in a floating dock at the bottom of the canvas and the file status as quiet chips in the top bar.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #0d0c14, the page under the glows
        smoke: #141220, glass panels at 78 percent with a 24px blur
        smokeSolid: #1a1830, the comment card
        field: #121022, inputs inside glass
        ink: #f4f2ff, text
        lavenderGrey: #c0bcd8, meta, labels and chips
        glowViolet: #6b4cff, a mesh glow and the selected row tint
        glowTeal: #00b3a4, a mesh glow and the selected row tint
        glowCoral: #ff7a59, a mesh glow
        violet: #8d78ff, frame icons, the frame outline and the focus halo
        teal: #3fd8c6, text icons and the Saved chip icon
        coral: #ff9a7a, instance icons and the version chip icon
        action: #4f35d6, Share and the active tool as a gradient to #2f5fd0 with white text
        guideViolet: #6d3df5, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        A rounded stack, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe
        UI, system-ui, with ui-monospace for values. Base 14px at 1.5. The
        file name is 15px 700, panel titles 15px 700, layer names 14px 650,
        values 13px mono, chips 12.5px and group labels 12px 700.
    layout:
        Four large blurred radial glows sit behind everything, violet top
        left, teal top right, coral bottom centre and blue bottom left. All
        panels are smoked glass with a 1px faint white rim and 20px corners. A
        full width top bar holds a gradient B tile, Canvas · Website redesign
        over Home v3, three status chips in the middle for Saved 2 minutes
        ago, 3 people editing and Version 41 with teal, violet and coral
        icons, then pastel avatars, Present and a gradient Share. Below sit a
        250px layers panel, the canvas and a 290px inspector. Layers show 32px
        icon tiles coloured by kind, the name and a sub line, Hero tinted
        violet to teal with a Selected tag. The white Hero frame floats with a
        violet outline and glow, and the tools sit in a glass dock centred at
        the bottom of the canvas with Move filled by the action gradient and
        66% after a divider. The inspector groups each property set in a
        lighter block, Position and size, Fill, Auto layout with Vertical,
        Corner radius and Export. Below 860px the panels stack and the dock is
        fixed at the bottom.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px around and between glass panels, 12px inside panels, 8px between blocks.
    density: Comfortable, with icon tiles beside each layer and grouped property blocks.
    corners: Soft. 20px panels, 14px rows, blocks and buttons, 10px fields, 22px dock.
    borders: A 1px white rim at 12 percent on glass and none inside, where blocks are lighter tints.
    shadows: Soft black 0 20px 50px under glass and a violet glow under the active tool, Share and the frame.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.7px stroke, 18px, coloured by layer kind in
        32px tiles. Selected is a circled check, Collapsed a right chevron,
        Saved a cloud with a check, always with the word.
    focus: A 2px white outline offset 2px with a 5px violet halo.
    tone: Friendly and light, with chips such as Saved 2 minutes ago and short labels such as Pad.
